      "title": "ETL Data Explorer - Overview",
      "text": "%md\n# ETL Data Explorer (Zeppelin)\n\nThis Zeppelin notebook mirrors the core analytics sections of `etl_data_explorer.ipynb` for the Finance ML Analytics Platform.\n\n**Goals**\n- Configuration & setup\n- Data loading + validation\n- ETL pipeline execution\n- Feature engineering\n- Analytics summaries\n\nNotes\n- Column normalization and schema utilities come from `finance_ml.core.schema` (single source of truth).\n- This notebook intentionally keeps code modular and defers heavy logic to `finance_ml` package modules.",
      "user": "anonymous",
